      <title>BlizzCon 2026 宣布《星际争霸》开放世界射击游戏定档 2030 年</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/game/post/20260913/BlizzCon-2026-%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E9%99%85%E4%BA%89%E9%9C%B8%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E5%B0%84%E5%87%BB%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E5%AE%9A%E6%A1%A3-2030-%E5%B9%B4/</link>
